Lancer was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a 5/5 for 7G Legendary with the Magic of adding 3 Spades to your hand. '''Beta 49.1''' dropped that to 2 Spades, but also gave it a passive effect that makes enemy monster take 2 more DMG from any spell.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 5

HP: 5

Cost: 7

Abilities:
* Magic: Add 3 Spades to your hand. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Enemy monsters take +2 DMG from spells. Magic: Add 2 Spades to your hand. (Post Beta 49.1, Current)
Rarity: Gold (Legendary)

Songs:
* Vs. Lancer (Post Beta 30.0)
* Lancer (Post Beta 50.0, Current)
